This directory contains useful scripts in scripts/ to generate experiments, 
obtain results from these experiments, and plot/present the results. The results
themselves are in results/. See details hereafter:

* scripts/generate_configs.py: This script is used to generate sets of synthetic
  application configurations. It generates a SQLLite database file. 
  
* scripts/run_configs.py: Based on a SQLList database file, this script invokes the simulator to fill in results in that database. 

* scripts/delta_t_evaluator.py: This script runs expected error upper/lower-bound computations, as well as simulations if needed, to quantify the effect of delta_t

* scripts/single_host_results_generation.py: This script takes as input a .csv file generated from a SQLLite database of results (see above), and outputs to the terminal relevant results for the one-PE case, as well as result plots. 

* scripts/multi_host_result_generation.py: This script takes as input a .csv file generated from
a SQLLite database of results (see above), and outputs to the terminal relevant results for the
multi-PE case. It also generates a .json file for algorithm ranking results.

* scripts/multi_host_statistical_significance.py: This script is used to determine the variations in strategy rankings for multiple half-size sample sets, so as to determine sensitivity to the (number of) samples, for the multi-PE case. 

* scripts/plot_data_parallel_results.py: This script plots the output generated by scripts/delta_t_evaluator.py script.

* scripts/plot_delta_t_results.py: This script plots delta_t results based on the .json output file generated by scripts/delta_t_evaluator.py.

* scripts/plot_multi_host_ranking.py: This script plots algorithm ranking results based on the .json output file generated by scripts/multi_host_result_generation.py.
